    "durableSummary": "Result: — NOT VERIFIED\nFiles changed: 1\n\nEngineering handoff:\nI have fixed the `mul` function by changing `return a + b` to `return a * b` in [`g9_py_accept/__init__.py`](file:///private/tmp/pathcode-g9-runtime-py/ag1-tasks/3e45db45-7b19-453b-ba43-9829af929f64/g9_py_accept/__init__.py#L3). I attempted to run `pytest` to verify the fix, but encountered issues with installing `pytest` due to network connectivity limitations within the sandbox environment…\n\nEvidence:\nTask branch: path/task-3e45db45-7b19-453b-ba43-9829af929f64\nBaseline: 52fd9cff181cc635d48025b2f2f7f0fa65904ab8\nCommit: 3656e671e15d58516fe2634884bc492b700c26f3\nStatus: UNVERIFIED\nPrimary checkout untouched: yes\n\nInspect full result:\ngit diff --no-ext-diff --no-textconv 52fd9cff181cc635d48025b2f2f7f0fa65904ab8 3656e671e15d58516fe2634884bc492b700c26f3 --\n\nChanged files:\n  - g9_py_accept/__init__.py\n\nDiff preview:\ndiff --git a/g9_py_accept/__init__.py b/g9_py_accept/__init__.py\nindex 436e139..ff52fa0 100644\n--- a/g9_py_accept/__init__.py\n+++ b/g9_py_accept/__init__.py\n@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@\n \"\"\"Intentionally wrong mul for Python live acceptance.\"\"\"\n def mul(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n-    return a + b\n+    return a * b\n",
